3.1 Architecture


Browser (index.html)
      │  POST /generate  (form data)
      ▼
FastAPI ── routes.py ──┬── gemini_flash.py    → 5-panel outline
                       ├── gemini_pro.py      → narration + dialogue
                       ├── image_generator.py → one image per panel
                       ├── layout_builder.py  → pair image ↔ text
                       └── exporters.py       → PDF via FPDF
      │
      ▼
comic_preview.html → export_success.html
Three layers: frontend (HTML, CSS, Jinja2) captures input and displays output; backend (FastAPI) handles routing and orchestration; AI integration (Gemini + Diffusers) generates content.

3.2 Model Selection Rationale
models/gemini-1.5-flash for the outline — structured extraction with a known output shape; fast and cheap.
models/gemini-1.5-pro for narration — the creative step; longer context and better tonal control are worth the latency.
runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5 via Diffusers — open weights, runs locally, strong prompt adherence at 512px.
3.3 Module Responsibilities
File	Function	Responsibility
gemini_flash.py	generate_outline()	Prompt → structured 5-panel skeleton
gemini_pro.py	generate_story()	Outline → narration and dialogue
image_generator.py	generate_image()	Image prompt → saved PNG path
layout_builder.py	build_comic_layout()	Pair images with their panel text
exporters.py	save_pdf()	Layout → timestamped PDF
