3.5 Template Design
index.html — centered fixed-width form, scenic background, five labelled fields, POST to /generate.
comic_preview.html — {% for panel in layout %} loop rendering title, image, italic scene description, caption/narration block, image-prompt reference; download button at the foot.
export_success.html — confirmation with the PDF path and a "Go Create Another Comic" return link.
3.6 Design Decisions and Trade-offs
Decision	Alternative rejected	Reason
Two LLMs instead of one	Single model for text	Each does one job it is optimised for
Sequential image generation	Batched generation	Bounded memory; failure isolation
One panel per PDF page	Multi-panel grid layout	Printed output stays readable
Prompt sanitised into filenames	UUID filenames	Reproducible, human-inspectable paths
Embedded CSS per template	Shared stylesheet	Simplicity for a three-page app
